Pipeline Design
The pipeline contains common stages and cloud-specific deployment stages.

Common Stages
1. Checkout
2. Maven build
3. Tests
4. OWASP Dependency-Check
5. SonarQube analysis 
6. Trivy Filesystem scan
7. Docker image build
8. Trivy container-image scan

AWS-Specific Stages:
1. Authenticate with Amazon ECR
2. Push Docker image to ECR
3. Configure access to Amazon EKS
4. Deploy application using Helm
5. Deploy/configure monitoring
6. Verify Kubernetes resources

GCP-Specific Stages:
1. Authenticate with Google Cloud
2. Push Docker image to Artifactory Registry
3. Configure access to GKE
4. Deploy application using Helm
5. Deploy/configure monitoring
6. Verify Kubernetes resources

The CLOUD_PROVIDER parameter controls the cloud-specific path while the application build and security stages remain common.

