6.6 Jenkins Kubernetes Configuration

When Jenkins requires access to the GKE cluster through the cofigured kubeconfig, ensure that the Jenkins user's kubeconfig is available.

Example:
sudo mkdir -p /var/lib/jenkins/.kube
sudo cp ~/.kube/config /var/lib/jenkins/.kube/config
sudo chown -R jenkins:jenkins /var/lib/jenkins/.kube
sudo chmod 700 /var/lib/jenkins/.kube
