11.3 Application Monitoring Limitation

The current Spring Boot application does not expose the Prometheus HTTP server request metric:
http_server_requests_seconds_count

Therefore, the project does not claim to provide:
•	HTTP request rate
•	HTTP response latency
•	HTTP request duration
•	Appplication endpoint-level performace metrics

The custom Application Overview dashboard instead focuses on application workload CPU and memory usage.

This is an intentional documentation boundary and avoids claiming application-level HTTP metrics that are not actually exposed by the current application.

